{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24449","headline":"三年冬随事铺设小堂寝处稍似稳暖因念衰病偶吟所怀 · 白居易","name":"三年冬随事铺设小堂寝处稍似稳暖因念衰病偶吟所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小宅非全陋，中堂不甚卑。\n聊堪会亲族，足以贮妻儿。\n暖帐迎冬设，温炉向夜施。\n裘新青兔褐，褥软白猨皮。\n似鹿眠深草，如鸡宿稳枝。\n逐身安枕席，随事有屏帷。\n病致衰残早，贫营活计迟。\n由来蚕老後，方是茧成时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}